    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker">Scope, then a number</p>
        <h1>Services</h1>
        <p class="lede">Five kinds of work. None of them has a price on this page. I quote a fee after a short intake, once the region and the scope are clear. I am not stating a commission policy, because I have not settled one for the site to announce.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrap grid-2">
        <article class="package" id="consult">
          <h2>Consultation call</h2>
          <p>One conversation to sort budget, time in Peru, purpose, climate, and whether I am the right person. You should leave with a clearer yes or no on the kind of region, a list of what to verify next, and a view on renting first.</p>
          <p>Write through the <a href="contact.html">intake form</a>. I reply with a time and a fee for the call before we book it.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="package" id="scout">
          <h2>Scouting trip</h2>
          <p>I go, or a trusted local contact goes where I do not personally cover. Photos, video, a drone where flying is appropriate and legal, neighbors, the surrounding block, condition, and the boundary against the <span lang="es">plano</span>. More than one time of day.</p>
          <p>The fee reflects region, how many properties, and travel. Details are on the <a href="scout.html">scouting page</a>.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="package" id="remote">
          <h2>Remote viewing</h2>
          <p>A live video call while I walk, so you can direct the camera. For buyers who cannot be in Peru this month. It does not replace a rainy-season look if that season is when the road matters.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="package" id="full">
          <h2>Full-service purchase accompaniment</h2>
          <p>Search, a shortlist, scouting, price compared with local ranges, and company through the sequence. I introduce an independent lawyer and notary. If you sign by <span lang="es">poder</span>, I help you understand the scope. I do not sign as your lawyer. I do not replace the notary.</p>
          <p>This is the widest engagement. The fee is quoted when we know how wide.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="package" id="after">
          <h2>Post-purchase oversight</h2>
          <p>Caretaker check-ins, a look after storms, help understanding bills, introductions for a <span lang="es">maestro</span> or an engineer, and a cadence of photos. This is not a property-management company. I do not collect rent as a licensed administrator.</p>
          <p>If you want short stays or a long-term tenant, local rules have to be checked, and you may need a local manager. I can help you see that clearly. See <a href="after.html">after the purchase</a>.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="package">
          <h2>What is not a package</h2>
          <p>Legal advice, tax advice, immigration advice, a guaranteed resale, a residency, and a personal visit to every corner of Peru. Those limits are also on the <a href="about.html">about page</a>.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
